Done. Here's what I implemented:

**`src/format/cost.rs`** — Two new functions:
• estimate_remaining_turns(messages, max_context) — counts assistant turns, computes average context growth per turn via `total_tokens(), projects how many more turns fit. Returns None` with < 2 turns (not enough data).
